          "text": "Quarterly Field Report",
          "lines": 1,
          "lineHeight": 0.03265483575139469,
          "box": [
            0.1404487123834863, 0.036209813654953682, 0.38197310847939603, 0.054346450169881155
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": false,
          "lines": 3,
          "lineHeight": 0.018848499646167451,
          "text": "The survey ran from 3 March to 28 April across four regions. Response rates were higher than expected in the north, where volunteers visited every household twice before marking it as absent.",
          "box": [
            0.12820387552944659, 0.10831870967381985, 0.5647951827765747, 0.098345367113749083
          ],
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "lineHeight": 0.022433553265424507,
          "box": [
            0.12807360771952597, 0.18656412043055459, 0.1479551977444189, 0.029521195093790586
          ],
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Key findings",
          "lines": 1,
          "title": false
        },
        {
          "lines": 1,
          "box": [
            0.14395003533470535, 0.22215686613728181, 0.34987806409134148, 0.040330878893534261
          ],
          "lineHeight": 0.018854512493986075,
          "kind": "text",
          "title": false,
          "text": "• Water access improved in 62% of villages"
        },
        {
          "title": false,
          "lines": 1,
          "lineHeight": 0.017085630714196082,
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "• Two clinics closed; one reopened in June",
          "box": [
            0.14401540002774735, 0.24835931884265028, 0.34166401284963976, 0.034593085447947258
          ]
        },
        {
          "lineHeight": 0.018756458751159076,
          "title": false,
          "lines": 1,
          "kind": "text",
          "box": [
            0.13883962957083407, 0.27181924426459503, 0.37806994186164189, 0.037846493721008345
          ],
          "text": "• Average travel time fell from 41 to 27 minutes"
        },
        {
          "box": [
            0.10259989658302919, 0.45754640080188902, 0.41429300258814356, 0.041364745299021455
          ],
